{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Modular_Arithmetic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Modular Arithmetic)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of lattice points that the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/19074ef0dc41c667e16bb754c5b1ede062a31f36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19x+20y = 1909$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> passes through in Quadrant I.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/55799fe57f476d3d9257c0662cb571ec34f2759a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = \\frac{1909-19x}{20}.\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"37\" />\nIn order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to be an positive integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33ec2bb52b0e4b414052edfc4b1ad6e1f8152137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1909-19x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> must be a multiple of 20 greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/310cd110c1de9689172c645ddcb341c9b01cd55e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\le 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />.  This means that the ones digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33ec2bb52b0e4b414052edfc4b1ad6e1f8152137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1909-19x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the tens digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33ec2bb52b0e4b414052edfc4b1ad6e1f8152137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1909-19x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is even.  \n</p><p>The ones digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33ec2bb52b0e4b414052edfc4b1ad6e1f8152137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1909-19x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when the last digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the available options are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/288d3a9aec902ded0cbe31776af874ac98e4e84d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 11, 21 \\cdots 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />.  However, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d5841caacf355dd685f7d251898d2bc87bcb5b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1909-19x=1909-20x+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"231\" height=\"14\" />, the tens digit must be odd.  Thus, the only values that work are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296fac336caaa4265aa24b6ecbc408a348ad7e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1fd7cb028e27b8648efbfb002f3e6d4fcb33a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$51$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so there are only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> lattice points in the first quadrant.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Modular_Arithmetic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Modular_Arithmetic)\">Solution 2 (Modular Arithmetic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Modular Arithmetic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in Solution 1, we rearrange the equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/8/0b865584b8da520f7ddcaabf0531bd6e906364c4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = \\frac{1909 - 19x}{20}.\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"37\" />\nThis means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aeb9bf67ea83a3f617467c96918a65f975757690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1909 - 19x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> must be positive and divisible by 20, and we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, so we set it congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/3/fe3e58a8db24a2f6b7b7594d12633bfe8b1e3f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\pmod{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> and simplify from there:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d49d8b6b84b819682a1a56277d4274240e524fef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{rll} 1909 - 19x \\equiv &amp; 0  &amp; \\pmod{20} \\\\ 9 + x \\equiv      &amp; 0  &amp; \\pmod{20} \\\\ x \\equiv          &amp; -9 &amp; \\pmod{20} \\\\ x \\equiv          &amp; 11 &amp; \\pmod{20}. \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"77\" />\nSince our lattice points are in the first quadrant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, so we can start listing off our solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913a1e08281f0974af4e83f4d7ffb2694d911dbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 11, 31, 51, 71, 91, 111...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"17\" />. Noticing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/997f49eb3ad8b8a5f0935c53ac7552436488d9dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19(111) \\approx 19(101) = 1919 &gt; 1909$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"266\" height=\"20\" />, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58d1eed7be2e1dcbfd4f7fe86fba2eb7566d8bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$111$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is too large, and so our solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b7244f24f1f1887200e113cb0b5ab3c5ebbbccac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11, 31, 51, 71,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> lattice points.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/P